## Order of Execution

1. `frame_buffer.py` — Create new lock-free buffer (foundation)
2. `stream.py` — Remove lock from frame write path, use `LatestFrameBuffer`
3. `pipeline_orchestrator.py` — Rewrite with 3-thread pipeline
4. `camera_worker.py` — Spawn all 3 pipeline threads per camera
5. `camera.py` (api) — Read from `AnnotatedFrameBuffer`, add adaptive quality
6. `config.json` + `config.py` — Add pipeline config section
7. `main.py` — Clean startup via CameraRegistry

